"P628728088" "<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor midnightblue>ALERT: HOSTILE INCURSION REPORTED IN TALOS ISLAND. LOCAL AUTHORITIES DEPLOYED. FBSA EMERGENCY BEACON ENGAGED.<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor midnightblue>HOSTILE FORCES ANALYZED: PARAMILITARY REGIMENT - CODENAME: SKY RAIDERS; UNLICENSED USE OF ARCANE MATERIALS HAS ALSO BEEN DETECTED."
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P3798111625" "<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor midnightblue> {HeroName}, this is Citadel. PPD reports indicate that the attack is beginning to wane, and that enemy forces have begun to retreat. I've flagged Odysseus and Captain Castillo for immediate transportation to Zigursky Penitentiary.<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor midnightblue>This task was exceptionally well-handled. I appreciate your assistance in this matter."
