// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1535592657" "You have angered Odysseus enough to force his hand!"
// Script Variable ACTOR1_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1500114714" "Glorious... simply glorious!"
// Script Variable ACTOR1_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1894732952" "Our confrontation will have a most thrilling backdrop! Do you not agree, {HeroName}?"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2740184650" "Ha ha ha ha! Your attacks have no soul, no life! Where is your shame, {HeroName}?"
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P815131128" "No... has the curtain... fallen already?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
