"P1067696635" "<t 2><t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>*kschhh*This is Omega Team reporting. Multiple MHIs have been reported in the area, fan out and-<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>Hold on... what was that?<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>We've got movement! Open fire! OPEN FI-*kschhh*"
