// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound2_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P7215858" "Return to James Harvan"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1825710434" "Doctor Harvan will surely be interested in your findings, {HeroName}. You should speak with him, so that you may combine your knowledge with his."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4240915689" "After speaking with Doctor Harvan, you're now confident in your findings. Pandora's Box is somewhere inside Zigursky Penitentiary."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3124115986" "<color orange>As you relate your experiences to Flashfire, his eyes widen with excitement.</color><br><br>You... you have discovered its location? Fantastic news, {HeroName}! I shall inform the Phalanx at once.<br><br>Your work in this matter has been exemplary, and Doctor Harvan's assistance has proven invaluable to our cause. It seems we are on the verge of containing this chaotic artifact once and for all."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - MillerTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2426040231" "<color orange>As you approach, Detective Miller favors you with a friendly smirk.</color><br><br>{HeroName}! Good to see ya. What brings you to our fine precinct? Alien invasion? Rogue wizards? No, no, don't tell me... <i>alien</i> rogue wizards?"
// Answer Text :
"P3402826369" "Funny. I need to get inside Zigursky prison."
// Page Question1 Text :
"P3034776389" "<color orange>Detective Miller's smile fades slowly. He stares at you blankly for a moment.</color><br><br>That's... not exactly the kind of place that has visiting hours, {HeroName}. I'm authorized to grant FBSA-licensed Heroes access, but... what business have you got in there?"
// Answer Text :
"P2776628315" "I have reason to believe that the structure of the prison has been compromised."
// Answer Text :
"P1858963677" "I'm afraid that's not a question I can answer, Detective. It's sensitive information."
// Page Question2 Text :
"P3286162087" "<color orange>Detective Miller frowns at you suspiciously.</color><br><br>Well, alright then.<br><br>In most cases, there'd be procedures you'd need to go through in order to get approved, but I know you've been working with the Phalanx lately. If Positron thinks you're on the up-and-up, then who am I to judge, eh?<br><br>Still, you can't just walk right in. We've got procedures in place to prevent security breaches. Get your people together. I'll patch in to the Zig, set up a convoy for you. It'll get you there quick enough."
// Answer Text :
"P2175008383" "Thanks, Detective. I'm ready whenever you are. (Start Mission)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - GuardTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page TaskIncomplete Text :
"P1381953069" "Welcome to the Zig, {HeroName}. Please be advised that any direct interaction with inmates needs to be supervised by... huh...<br><br><color orange>Detective Miller looks around, his brow furrowed.</color><br><br>Well, now... that's a bit odd..."
// Answer Text :
"P1089028266" "Doesn't security here seem a bit... light?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - OdysseusTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page TaskIncomplete Text :
"P3119447309" "<color orange>Odysseus grins at you venemously.</color><br><br>Welcome, {HeroName}. I was wondering if you'd catch on. The way things were going, I thought we were going to reach Pandora's Box right under your noses, with you being none the wiser.<br><br>I guess you're just a bit smarter than we took you for."
// Answer Text :
"P2792954908" "Since when do you work with the Sky Raiders?"
// Answer Text :
"P1505576816" "Sorry to ruin your 'master plan', if you could call it that."
// Page Raiders Text :
"P1514991271" "<color orange>Odysseus shrugs nonchalantly.</color><br><br>Captain Castillo and I have a... mutual friend, let's just say. We're working together, for now, because we've discovered that we can accomplish more as a combined force than otherwise. That's all you need to know.<br><br>You know, {HeroName}, when you first arrived at Talos, I was worried. I thought that, given your reputation, our plan might have unraveled right there on the spot. But no, you played right into our hands. I'm still amazed that you never considered-"
// Answer Text :
"P1025422506" "You're stalling, Odysseus. Why?"
// Page Taunt Text :
"P707381126" "Oh, come now. There's no need to get snappy. We're on opposite sides of this conflict, certainly... and I'm sure we each have our own reasons for seeking out Pandora's Box.<br><br>But I think we can all remain civil here, can't we? I can honestly say that I respect you, {HeroName}. You've got... <i>conviction</i>. A {Hero.gender=male man|woman} of your caliber, capable of taking whatever you want from those beneath you, and yet you still insist on fighting for-"
// Page Stalling Text :
"P1199129298" "<color orange>Odysseus breaks into a soft chuckle.</color><br><br>Oh, you <i>are</i> good. Still, I'm surprised you haven't noticed yet.<br><br>Zigursky is a <i>special</i> place, {HeroName}. Anyone stronger than your average street thug becomes significantly weaker in here. Fancy tech, magic spells, even higher-than-average strength and speed are... 'capped' while you're doing time.<br><br>And it doesn't discriminate. The moment you stepped through these walls, your powers have been slowly draining from you. And as you can see...<br><br><color orange>Odysseus gestures behind him.</color><br><br>We have the numbers advantage. So... how are you feeling, {HeroName}?"
// Answer Text :
"P1545227639" "Hm. I don't feel any different, actually."
// Page Stalling2 Text :
"P2581957300" "<img align=left src=costume:Model_James_Harvan width=128 height=128>Actually, according to my theories, the manipulative effects of the Antikythera are capable of not only detecting, but also <i>bending</i> the streams of power emanating from and retracting towards Pandora's Box. Anyone with possession of the Antikythera would be mostly unaffected by power alterations caused by the Box, for as long as they keep the Antikythera nearby.<br><br>In short, I believe that you are immune to the power-draining effects of this prison, {HeroName}."
// Answer Text :
"P717181939" "I see."
// Page Stalling3 Text :
"P4090078480" "<color orange>Upon hearing Doctor Harvan's words, Odysseus begins to sweat profusely.</color><br><br>That's not... but...<br><br>You're bluffing! I don't buy it! You think we'd fall for something so crass, {HeroName}? You underestimate me!<br><br><color orange>Odysseus turns his attention to the gathered inmates behind him.</color><br><br>It's time, boys! Take them all down, but leave the old man alive! He might still be useful!"
// Answer Text :
"P304645213" "You're full of poor choices these days, Odysseus."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - HarvanTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page TaskIncomplete Text :
"P3670567057" "<color orange>Harvan appears slightly paler than usual, after witnessing the carnage of the previous battle. He removes his hat, and rubs the top of his head nervously.</color><br><br>Well. That was... certainly interesting. I suppose it's those kinds of decisions that got them in here in the first place."
// Answer Text :
"P2201307648" "Please focus, Doctor. We're here for the Box."
// Page Explain Text :
"P3601163982" "Yes, yes, of course. Based on the blueprints you discovered, I would expect that Pandora's Box would be stored somewhere underneath the main facility. I doubt we'll find any direct or obvious access points, given that this may well have been the best-kept secret in the history of Paragon City.<br><br>I'll take a look around the area, see if I can line up the layouts with these blueprints. Er, that is...<br><br><color orange>Harvan glances around nervously.</color><br><br>If it's safe..."
// Answer Text :
"P3021987127" "I've cleared the area, Doctor. It should be fine."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3061155095" "I have contacted the Phalanx with the results of your discovery. Positron agrees that an investigation into Zigursky is warranted.<br><br>Doctor Harvan appears to have expressed an interest in joining you on this expedition, {HeroName}. Given his contributions to the search, and his expansive knowledge of the artifact's properties, Positron has assented to Harvan's position.<br><br>His only request was that, in order to ensure Doctor Harvan's safety, Fusionette be sent to accompany you as well. Are these conditions acceptable to you, {HeroName}?"
// AcceptString :
"P3685921217" "That's fine, Flashfire. Hopefully we won't encounter too much trouble."
// SendOffString :
"P2860227479" "<color orange>Flashfire bows slightly.</color><br><br>Your efforts in this task have been admirable, {HeroName}. Soon, this crisis will be averted, and we shall all be able to breathe a little easier."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1980409123" "Find Pandora's Box"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P737647743" "If you are seeking access to the Zig, I believe that one of the Detectives in Brickstown may be able to help you."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P710372271" "<color deepskyblue>Part Three: Imbalance of Power</color>"

