// Dialog :
"P3465920931" "Pandora's Box has been opened, with highly unexpected results. Now would be a good time to leave..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3693281623" "<color orange>Flashfire's face has taken on a slightly sickly color. He does not appear well.</color><br><br>Oh dear... oh dear. This is not a good development, {HeroName}, not at all.<br><br>If someone had found Pandora's Box first, we would be dealing with a very powerful foe. It would have been bad, but... <i>manageable</i>. Paragon has weathered threats of that nature before. But <i>this...</i><br><br>This is something else entirely, {HeroName}. Power manifest, running rampant throughout the city? Throughout the <i>world</i>? It could be utter chaos... simply unfathomable.<color orange>Flashfire swallows hard, and he stares at you, determined.</color><br><br>This cannot be left to stand, {HeroName}. We must do something to fix this. Many, <i>many</i> lives are at stake."
// RandomFameString :
"P713640232" "Did you hear? There was some power surge in Brickstown, and they had to evacuate the whole Zig!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
